=2 Walkthrough
!Bostaunieux Oubliette-map2.jpg|right|Bostaunieux Oubliette Map 2
Trade enough {p:Crystals} to the {p:Conquest NPC} to raise your Rank bar and unlock the Mission, then accept it from the {n:Gate Guard}.
* Head to the **Cathedral** in {z:Northern San d'Oria} and go to the **Papal Chambers**, located on the third floor at (M-6).
* If you're low level, form a party and/or use {p:Trusts|Trust}.
** {p:Sneaking|Sneak (Status)} is recommended, bring some {@i:Silent Oil|4165} {i:Silent Oils|Silent Oil|4165}.
* Head to {z:Bostaunieux Oubliette}, which can be accessed from {z:Chateau d'Oraguille} (I-8). If you already explored the place, alternate paths are available below.
** Head for (E-7/8) and use {s:Sneak}. Speak to {n:Couchatorage} standing by the **Sewer Lid** to drop down to Map 2. Be sure to grab the **{p:Survival Guide}** nearby if this is your first time here.
** Follow the right wall and you'll eventually zone to {z:West Ronfaure} at (E-8). There will be a **???** in front of you.
* When prepared, check the **???** to spawn an {m:Orc} NM {m:Marauder Dvogzog}.
** It is a level 67 MNK with approximately 16,000 HP, capable of using {p:Hundred Fists}.
* Check the **???** again to receive the {@k} {k:Ancient San d'Orian tablet}.
** Should you fall off of the ledge, you'll need to run back through the {z:Oubliette|Bostaunieux Oubliette} and fight the NM again.
* Return to the **Cathedral** and visit the **Papal Chambers** for the final cutscene.

=4 Alternate Paths
* {p:Unity Warp}: If you have dropped down the **Sewer Lid** in {z:Bostaunieux Oubliette} at least once, the Level 122 {p:Unity Warp} can teleport you directly to {z:Bostaunieux Oubliette}, right at the zone line to {z:West Ronfaure}.
* {p:Proto-Waypoint}: The {z:West Ronfaure} {p:Proto-Waypoint} will get you directly to your destination, provided you've already unlocked it.

